M(2,"w2t2","def",2,"For Barthes, a myth is…",["a naturalized connotation accepted as normal and natural","a creation story about the world","the literal meaning of a sign","a sign with a physical connection to its object"],"Barthes' myth ≠ religious myth.");
M(2,"w2t2","people",2,"Olzhas Suleimenov's 'AZ i IA' focuses on which epic?",["The Tale of Igor's Campaign","Kyz Zhibek","Koblandy batyr","The Book of Dede Korkut"],"Russian epic; Slav and Turk in shared Eurasian space.");
M(2,"w2t2","theory",3,"Which statement best describes the idea of 'AZ i IA'?",["Slav and Turk share a common cultural-historical space – Eurasia","Kazakh culture is purely Indo-European","Russian culture has no Turkic elements","Culture is like a text interpreted through symbols"],"It challenges Indo-European linguistics.");
