M(7,"w7t3","def",1,"Cultural intelligence (CQ) is…",["the capability to function effectively in intercultural contexts","a test score of cognitive ability relative to age","the ability to manage one's own emotions","knowledge of one's own national history"],"Earley & Ang 2003.");
