S(7,"w7t5","compare",2,"Compare digital and physical museums: give two advantages and two disadvantages of digital museums.",[["access","anywhere","24","online"],["preserv","3d","fragile","backup"],["authentic","aura","emotion","real object"],["divide","internet","technical","server","cost"]],"Advantages: access from anywhere 24/7 and inclusivity; preservation of fragile objects via 3D scans and backups; interactive education; can show stolen or destroyed heritage. Disadvantages: no authentic 'aura' or emotional effect of the real object; digital divide and technical/format risks; they preserve information about heritage rather than the heritage itself.");

