M(8,"w8t4","def",3,"Long- vs Short-Term Orientation was originally described as…",["Pragmatic vs Normative","Masculine vs Feminine","Indulgent vs Restrained","High vs Low context"],"PRA.");
M(8,"w8t4","apply",3,"In a society people are loyal to their group, defend its interests and take responsibility for one another's well-being. Which pole is this?",["Collectivism","Individualism","Low power distance","Indulgence"],"Collectivist.");
