M(10,"w10t2","compare",3,"Which Kazakhstani World Heritage site is NATURAL?",["Saryarka – Steppe and Lakes of Northern Kazakhstan","Tamgaly petroglyphs","Mausoleum of Khoja Ahmed Yasawi","Silk Roads: Chang'an–Tianshan Corridor"],"Natural: Saryarka, Western Tien-Shan, Cold Winter Deserts of Turan.");
